WEBVTT

00:13:59.422 --> 00:14:01.491
We have the coast, we have the Andes

00:14:01.515 --> 00:14:03.401
and we have a bit of jungle.

00:14:03.913 --> 00:14:05.998
AG: This is Gonzalo Adriazola.

00:14:06.022 --> 00:14:08.467
When he was 19,
he and his mother left Peru

00:14:08.491 --> 00:14:10.260
and moved to rural Ohio.

00:14:10.743 --> 00:14:12.443
GA: I don't think I fully processed

00:14:12.467 --> 00:14:15.459
that I was leaving a whole life behind.

00:14:15.483 --> 00:14:18.210
I think I was just excited for the future.

00:14:18.234 --> 00:14:20.260
AG: As a young immigrant to a new country,

00:14:20.284 --> 00:14:22.864
Gonzalo didn't know exactly
what the future held,

00:14:22.888 --> 00:14:25.878
but his mother became
a tremendous source of inspiration.

00:14:25.902 --> 00:14:29.171
From early on, she taught him
about the importance of education.

00:14:29.195 --> 00:14:30.614
GA: She would always tell me,